      "description": "Synthetic caller speech from Google's gemini-3.8-flash-tts (prebuilt voices Kore for the women callers and Charon for the men), requested as 24 kHz PCM and resampled to 16 kHz with ffmpeg by case-build/render_caller_audio.py. The voices are AI-generated, not recordings of a person. Google is neither the build's model vendor (Anthropic) nor its speech vendor (Deepgram in and out). OpenAI was not used: the account had no credit."
